{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49492","headline":"木兰花 一 · 顾敻","name":"木兰花 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月照玉楼春漏促，飒飒风摇庭砌竹。\n梦惊鸳被觉来时，何处管弦声断续。\n惆怅少年游冶去，枕上两蛾攒细绿。\n晓莺帘外语花枝，背帐犹残红蜡烛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾敻","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49492.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49492","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}